data emitter_produced_baseline_note: String = "Review 44362/44441/44453: frontier EmitterProduced count stays zero until a restored SelfHostWetReceiptBinding authorizes BuildGreen. Promotion order is acyclic: execute wet (known-red) → restore binding → BuildGreen → EmitterProduced. Oracle enrollment (six quarantine rows) and frontier disposition (SeedRetained until authorized) are orthogonal."

